Just saw the trailer of #Ranabali and wow, what an immersive experience! The detailing in recreating 1800s Rayalaseema and capturing that heart-wrenching era of British-era famine and oppression is phenomenal.

@TheDeverakonda looks effortlessly fierce and completely at home in the soil of Seema, brilliantly anchored by @iamRashmika. Kudos to @Rahul_Sankrityn and the entire team for bringing such a powerful, untold chapter of history to life. Wishing you all huge success on October 16!

